---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import SalvationSwitcher from "../components/react/SalvationSwitcher";
import "../assets/styles/salvation-switcher.css";
---

<PageLayout
  title="How to reach us"
  content=""
>
  <div class="location-section">
  <section class="how-to-reach">
    <h2>By Public Transport</h2>
    <p> Reaching us by public transport is easy! You can either take the metro or the commuter train.</p>
    <p>
      If you decide to take the metro (Tunnelbana) you can take the <strong>blue line toward Akalla (T10)</strong> and get off at <strong>Solna Strand</strong> or toward <strong>Hjulsta (T11)</strong> and get off at <strong>Sundbyberg station</strong>. 
      From both stations, it is about a 10-minute walk to the church.  
     </p>
     <p> 
      If you decide to take the commuter train (Pendeltåg) you can take the line 43/44 towards <strong>Bålsta, Kungsängen or Kallhäll</strong> and get off at <strong>Sundbyberg station</strong>.    
      </br> From there, it's about a 10-minute walk to the church as well.
    </p>
    <h2>By Car</h2>
    <p>
      If you're driving, you can use the following address for your GPS: <address>Trädgårdsgatan 6, 172 38 Sundbyberg</address>
    </br> You can find free parking spaces on the streets around the church, but they are limited.
    </br>There is, however, a paid parking place at Stamgårdsparken. </br> It is 25 SEK per hour and it is handled through the Aimo park app.
    </p>
  </section>
   <iframe
        class="location-content"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2042.0667629209668!2d18.14537527669999!3d59.21489902017553!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x465f9dae0722d67b%3A0x165a643e34141b71!2sSmyrna%20Bible%20Baptist%20Church%20-%20Stockholm%20mission!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sse!4v1756428667096!5m2!1sen!2sse"
        allowfullscreen=""
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
        </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .how-to-reach {
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .location-content {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 0;
    height: 400px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .location-section {
      display: flex;
    }
    .location-content{
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 500px;
      margin-inline: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
